--
Verifies that libstdc++'s std::pair<int, int> instantiates fully
and a user `std::pair<int, int> p;` produces a tag-pair symbol AND
a real DECL in main's goto body.  Regression for the
member-function-template signature typecheck fix in
typecheck_compound_body's second pass.
